  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Southern Border, Ye Fan chases a blue speck of light through a mountain forest while using ape transformation. He names the target Blue Face Gu: a rank three Gu of transformation path that can change a male Gu Master’s appearance, and he needs it because he is under an arrest warrant.",
        "chapters": [
          823
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_southern_border",
          "char_ye_fan",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Rain and then wildfire on tung oil mountain break his chase. At the mountain base a blue light returns: that Blue Face Gu, soot-covered and weak. He grabs and refines it within a few breaths because it is too weak to resist. He had not expected to obtain it that way.",
        "chapters": [
          823
        ],
